<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AutoZone raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AutoZone raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday it had raised its rating for AutoZone Inc to near-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- AutoZone kept its long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Memphis, Tenn., auto parts retailer closed on Monday at 24-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
